SUMMARY
 The tournament clock turns a runner system into a closed walk in G_n.
 Pattern probes: #cells vs sum|s_i-s_j|; distinct iso-classes vs speed
 arithmetic structure; whether the transitive tournament is visited
 (a clean global ranking moment) and how often.
